<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Software Engineering on Adhika Setya Pramudita</title><link>https://adhikasp.my.id/tags/software-engineering/</link><description>Recent content in Software Engineering on Adhika Setya Pramudita</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 12:36:25 +0700</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://adhikasp.my.id/tags/software-engineering/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Sorting Algorithm Time Scaling</title><link>https://adhikasp.my.id/notebook/sorting-algorithm-time-scaling/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 11:53:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://adhikasp.my.id/notebook/sorting-algorithm-time-scaling/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Sorting is one of those basic algorithms that new programmer and CS students learn.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Maybe you already see the &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sorting_algorithm#Comparison_of_algorithms"&gt;big-O comparison in Wikipedia&lt;/a&gt;, or few sites that visualize how the element in sorting move around like &lt;a href="https://sortvisualizer.com/quicksort/"&gt;this&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;In this notebook, we will compare the actual time comparison of different sorting algorithms.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;h1 id="generating-sample-data"&gt;Generating sample data&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;First we need to get random list of integers with different size.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#cf222e"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#24292e"&gt;numpy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#cf222e"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#24292e"&gt;np&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;sizes &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;**&lt;/span&gt;i &lt;span style="color:#cf222e"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; i &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#6639ba"&gt;range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;)]&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;random_arrays &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;{}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#cf222e"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; size &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; sizes&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; random_arrays&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;size&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; np&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;random&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;randint&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; size&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; size&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;size&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#6639ba"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0a3069"&gt;&amp;#34;Generated arrays of sizes:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#6639ba"&gt;list&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;random_arrays&lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;keys&lt;span style="color:#1f2328"&gt;()))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="cell-output"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;pre class="cell-output-text"&gt;Generated arrays of sizes: [16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024, 2048, 4096, 8192, 16384, 32768, 65536, 131072]&#10;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;h2 id="sorting-library"&gt;Sorting library&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;We will use &lt;a href="https://github.com/m3xw3ll/SortingAlgorithmsVisualizer"&gt;sortingx&lt;/a&gt; library to quickly get multiple different sorting algorithms.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>